Subject: [PATCH] Explain limitation and preference handling, prefer named
 exercises, show bare feet in demos

The routine rationale now states how many exercises a limitation removed and
which preferred exercises were placed first, or that a preference matched none.
Exercise demonstrations drop the separate shoe meshes, which never fitted the
animated foot, and render bare feet instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
